{"id":"o5oci7b6r7wplm91fs7542eme","title":"国际专家呼吁加强海洋监测以应对极端海洋热浪","originalTitle":"Call to improve global ocean monitoring to prepare for marine heat waves","summary":"国际专家在《自然》杂志上警告，太平洋温度上升并预测将出现极端厄尔尼诺气候事件，呼吁通过AI预测海洋热浪并加强全球海洋监测，以支持渔业和沿海社区的可持续发展。研究人员建议采取一系列行动方案，包括调整捕捞策略、暂时关闭渔业和改进水产养殖操作，并强调需要持续的资金支持和跨部门合作。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-global-ocean-marine.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T12:00:15.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T16:17:51.893Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T16:17:51.893Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":44,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a1d925ac-3dff-43e6-8344-8ff18d26b1bb","title":"国际专家呼吁加强海洋监测应对极端海洋热浪"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a1d925ac-3dff-43e6-8344-8ff18d26b1bb","title":"国际专家呼吁加强海洋监测应对极端海洋热浪"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fg52cWnSPAtc","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}